{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"Multica.MulticaDesktop","latestVersion":"0.9.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.b11dd61b.png","priority":1,"sha256":"b11dd61b50c956df9b76a45e6bf67d26b589c77247bbfe0771183029c4309377","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"© 2026 Multica. All rights reserved.","description":"The open-source managed agents platform. Turn coding agents into real teammates — assign tasks, track progress, compound skills.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Docs","DocumentUrl":"https://multica.ai/docs"}],"license":"Freeware","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"© 2026 Multica. All rights reserved.","description":"The open-source managed agents platform. Turn coding agents into real teammates — assign tasks, track progress, compound skills.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Docs","DocumentUrl":"https://multica.ai/docs"}],"license":"Freeware","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Multica turns coding agents into real teammates. Assign issues to an agent like you'd assign to a colleague — they'll pick up the work, write code, report blockers, and update statuses autonomously.\nNo more copy-pasting prompts. No more babysitting runs. Your agents show up on the board, participate in conversations, and compound reusable skills over time. Think of it as open-source infrastructure for managed agents — vendor-neutral, self-hosted, and designed for human + AI teams. Works with Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot CLI, OpenClaw, OpenCode, Hermes, Gemini, Pi, Cursor Agent, Kimi, and Kiro CLI.\nFor larger teams, Squads add a stable routing layer: assign work to a group led by an agent, and the leader delegates to the right member.","name":"Multica","packageUrl":"https://multica.ai/download","publisher":"Multica","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica/issues","publisherUrl":"https://multica.ai/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica/releases/tag/v0.9.0","tags":["agent","agent-team","agentic","ai","chatbot","code","coding","large-language-model","llm","multi-agent","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"开源托管智能体助手平台。将编程智能体转化为真正的团队伙伴 —— 分配任务、跟踪进度、复用技能。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://multica.ai/docs"}],"license":"免费软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Multica 将代码智能体转变为真正的团队伙伴。你可以像给同事分配任务一样给智能体分配 Issue —— 它们会自动接手工作、编写代码、报告阻碍并自主更新状态。\n无需再反复复制粘贴提示词，也无需再盯守运行过程。你的智能体将出现在任务看板上，参与对话，并随时间积累可复用的技能。将其视为受管智能体的开源基础设施 —— 厂商中立、支持私有化部署，专为“人+AI”团队设计。兼容 Claude Code、Codex、GitHub Copilot CLI、OpenClaw、OpenCode、Hermes、Gemini、Pi、Cursor Agent、Kimi 和 Kiro CLI。\n对于更大的团队，Squads（小队）增加了一个稳定的路由层：将工作分配给一个由智能体领导的小组，领导者会将其委派给最合适的成员。","tags":["人工智能","代码","多智能体","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Multica turns coding agents into real teammates. Assign issues to an agent like you'd assign to a colleague — they'll pick up the work, write code, report blockers, and update statuses autonomously.\nNo more copy-pasting prompts. No more babysitting runs. Your agents show up on the board, participate in conversations, and compound reusable skills over time. Think of it as open-source infrastructure for managed agents — vendor-neutral, self-hosted, and designed for human + AI teams. Works with Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot CLI, OpenClaw, OpenCode, Hermes, Gemini, Pi, Cursor Agent, Kimi, and Kiro CLI.\nFor larger teams, Squads add a stable routing layer: assign work to a group led by an agent, and the leader delegates to the right member.","name":"Multica","packageUrl":"https://multica.ai/download","publisher":"Multica","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica/issues","publisherUrl":"https://multica.ai/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/multica-ai/multica/releases/tag/v0.9.0","tags":["agent","agent-team","agentic","ai","chatbot",